---
const decisions = [
  'Why this section exists for the business — not the template author',
  'Why the CMS is structured so clients can edit without breaking the site',
  'Why components stay reusable across pages without becoming a trap',
  'Why naming, folders, and handoff standards matter when you ship',
];
---

<section id="philosophy" class="fs-band fs-band--brand">
  <div class="fs-wrap fs-philosophy">
    <p class="fs-kicker fs-kicker--on-brand">Teaching philosophy</p>
    <h2 class="fs-philosophy-quote" data-philosophy-quote>
      Teach decisions,<br />not clicks.
    </h2>
    <p class="fs-philosophy-lead">The why is the product. Framer is simply the tool.</p>

    <ul class="fs-philosophy-list" data-philosophy>
      {decisions.map((item) => (
        <li data-philosophy-item>{item}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
